<p> Earnings per share (R)		0.44			1.76</p>
<p>Analysts consensus for the quarter is $0.48 per share, according to First Call.</p>
<p>The company's full name is Automatic Data Processing Inc.</p>
<p>Non-recurring items include an anticipated loss on the previously announced disposition of the AutoInfo business which reduced earnings per share by $0.04; a non-taxable gain of about $19 million relating to a deposit returned to ADP as a result of a previously announced cancellation of a brokerage front office client contract; and a provision of about $31 million, or $19 million after tax, to reduce product lines and platforms and consolidate data centers in the Brokerage front office business.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
